    dcterms:creator "World Intellectual Property Organization (WIPO)" ;
    rdfs:comment "The page shows no license. Used for facts only: nothing copied. Reliability: authoritative (a summary by the organization that administers the treaty). Read in October 2026. Used for: chapter 1: that protection is automatic and depends on no formality such as registration or a © notice, and that copying, translating and adapting a work need the right holder's permission."@en .

<https://www.wto.org/english/docs_e/legal_e/27-trips_04_e.htm>
