                    "`AND`"@ko ,
                    "`AND`"@de ,
                    "`AND`"@es ,
                    "`AND`"@fr ;
    solid-memo:backNote "The specification uses `AND` when both licenses apply at the same time, as in `LGPL-2.1-only AND MIT`."@en ,
