<#q-spdx-reuse-2c>
    a solid-memo:Card ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 5 ;
    solid-memo:textFormat solid-memo:markdown ;
    dcterms:created "2026-10-31T00:00:00.000Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    solid-memo:front "Written with parentheses, what does the SPDX expression `LGPL-2.1-only OR BSD-3-Clause AND MIT` mean?"@en ,
                     "Hur skrivs SPDX-uttrycket `LGPL-2.1-only OR BSD-3-Clause AND MIT` med parenteser?"@sv ,
                     "SPDX 표현식 `LGPL-2.1-only OR BSD-3-Clause AND MIT`를 괄호로 묶어 쓰면 어떻게 됩니까?"@ko ,
                     "Was bedeutet der SPDX-Ausdruck `LGPL-2.1-only OR BSD-3-Clause AND MIT`, mit Klammern geschrieben?"@de ,
                     "Escrita con paréntesis, ¿qué significa la expresión SPDX `LGPL-2.1-only OR BSD-3-Clause AND MIT`?"@es ,
                     "Réécrite avec des parenthèses, que signifie l’expression SPDX `LGPL-2.1-only OR BSD-3-Clause AND MIT` ?"@fr ;
    solid-memo:back "`LGPL-2.1-only OR (BSD-3-Clause AND MIT)`"@en ,
                    "`LGPL-2.1-only OR (BSD-3-Clause AND MIT)`"@sv ,
                    "`LGPL-2.1-only OR (BSD-3-Clause AND MIT)`"@ko ,
                    "`LGPL-2.1-only OR (BSD-3-Clause AND MIT)`"@de ,
                    "`LGPL-2.1-only OR (BSD-3-Clause AND MIT)`"@es ,
                    "`LGPL-2.1-only OR (BSD-3-Clause AND MIT)`"@fr ;
    solid-memo:backNote "`AND` binds tighter than `OR`, so `BSD-3-Clause` and `MIT` are grouped first, whatever the order of writing."@en ,
                        "`AND` binder starkare än `OR`, så `BSD-3-Clause` och `MIT` grupperas först, oavsett i vilken ordning de skrivs."@sv ,
                        "`AND`가 `OR`보다 강하게 결합하므로, 쓰인 순서와 상관없이 `BSD-3-Clause`와 `MIT`가 먼저 묶입니다."@ko ,
                        "`AND` bindet stärker als `OR`, also werden `BSD-3-Clause` und `MIT` zuerst gruppiert, unabhängig von der Reihenfolge im Text."@de ,
                        "`AND` tiene más precedencia que `OR`, así que `BSD-3-Clause` y `MIT` se agrupan primero, sea cual sea el orden en que se escriban."@es ,
                        "`AND` a priorité sur `OR` : `BSD-3-Clause` et `MIT` sont donc regroupés d’abord, quel que soit l’ordre d’écriture."@fr ;
    solid-memo:distractor <#q-spdx-reuse-2c-d1> ,
                          <#q-spdx-reuse-2c-d2> ,
                          <#q-spdx-reuse-2c-d3> .

<#q-spdx-reuse-2c-d1>
    a solid-memo:Distractor ,
      schema:Answer ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 1 ;
    solid-memo:distractorText "`(LGPL-2.1-only OR BSD-3-Clause) AND MIT`"@en ,
                              "`(LGPL-2.1-only OR BSD-3-Clause) AND MIT`"@sv ,
                              "`(LGPL-2.1-only OR BSD-3-Clause) AND MIT`"@ko ,
                              "`(LGPL-2.1-only OR BSD-3-Clause) AND MIT`"@de ,
                              "`(LGPL-2.1-only OR BSD-3-Clause) AND MIT`"@es ,
                              "`(LGPL-2.1-only OR BSD-3-Clause) AND MIT`"@fr ;
    solid-memo:distractorNote "That applies `OR` first, but `AND` binds tighter."@en ,
                              "Det tillämpar `OR` först, men `AND` binder starkare."@sv ,
                              "`OR`를 먼저 적용했지만, `AND`가 더 강하게 결합합니다."@ko ,
                              "Das wendet `OR` zuerst an, aber `AND` bindet stärker."@de ,
                              "Aplica primero `OR`, pero `AND` tiene más precedencia."@es ,
                              "Cela applique `OR` en premier, alors que `AND` a priorité."@fr .

<#q-spdx-reuse-2c-d2>
    a solid-memo:Distractor ,
      schema:Answer ;
    solid-memo:formatVersion 1 ;
    solid-memo:distractorText "`(LGPL-2.1-only OR MIT) AND BSD-3-Clause`"@en ,
                              "`(LGPL-2.1-only OR MIT) AND BSD-3-Clause`"@sv ,
                              "`(LGPL-2.1-only OR MIT) AND BSD-3-Clause`"@ko ,
                              "`(LGPL-2.1-only OR MIT) AND BSD-3-Clause`"@de ,
                              "`(LGPL-2.1-only OR MIT) AND BSD-3-Clause`"@es ,
                              "`(LGPL-2.1-only OR MIT) AND BSD-3-Clause`"@fr ;
