                              "프로젝트 루트의 `COPYING.txt`"@ko ,
                              "`COPYING.txt` im Wurzelverzeichnis"@de ,
                              "`COPYING.txt` en la raíz del proyecto"@es ,
                              "`COPYING.txt` à la racine du projet"@fr ;
    solid-memo:distractorNote "REUSE allows such a file, but its tool ignores it; license files go in `LICENSES`."@en ,
